    {"before": "V04", "after": "V01", "confidence": 0.95},
    {"before": "V05", "after": "V01", "confidence": 0.75}
  ],
  "rationale": "Earthquake hitting and burglar entering are upstream causes that can trigger the home alarm. The alarm going off precedes notifying neighbors. The first neighbor call is plausibly earlier than the second neighbor call, as a downstream sequence of notifications."
}
